{
    "title": "xMUSI - Simple Music Streaming",
    "description": "Discover millions of trending songs & popular tracks with Music Stream. Powered by SoundCloud, our app offers an unparalleled audio experience, tailored for true music enthusiasts. \r\n\r\nWhether you're exploring new genres or enjoying your favorite hits, Music Stream is your gateway to a world of limitless free music. Enjoy seamless streaming, curated playlists & a user-friendly interface designed to elevate your listening experience. \r\n\r\n<b>Key Features: </b>\r\n\u25cf Artists Spotlight: Discover albums & playlists by top artists. \r\n\u25cf Global Top Charts & Playlists: Tune into trending songs & international chart toppers. \r\n\u25cf Genre Explorer: Dive into a diverse array of genres including pop, hip-hop, classical, & jazz. \r\n\u25cf Powerful Search: Find all tracks, artists, playlists & albums easily within the app. \r\n\u25cf High-Quality Streaming: Enjoy crystal-clear audio streaming with our equalizer & sound booster. \r\n\r\nMusic Stream is packed with features to enhance your listening experience. Here are just a few highlights of what you can do: \r\n\r\n<b>1. Explore Endless Tracks </b>\r\nEnter the world of unlimited free music. New high-quality songs await your discovery every day, from chart-toppers to hidden gems. \r\n- Access millions of free, high-quality songs across all genres \r\n- Discover new tracks daily & listen to top trending songs \r\n- Stay updated with daily top charts & trending songs \r\n\r\n<b>2. Curate Your Playlists </b>\r\nBecome the curator of your audio world. Build playlists that reflect your essence. Import & export, like your playlists to bookmark them and make your personal online music collection accessible anywhere, anytime. \r\n- Create & manage your playlists of favorite songs \r\n- Save favorite artists, albums, & genres \r\n- Build your online music collection for easy access to high-quality songs \r\n\r\n<b>3. Your Songs, Anytime, Anywhere</b>\r\nEnjoy your favorite playlists, artists, & albums without compromise. Our free music player ensures high-quality song streaming wherever you go. \r\n- Access your curated songs collection anywhere \r\n- Experience uninterrupted playback \r\n\r\n<b>4. Ambient Sounds & Mood-Based Playlists </b>\r\nEnhance any moment with our carefully curated selection of ambient sounds & mood-based playlists. \r\n- Find the perfect playlist for any mood or activity \r\n- Unwind with relaxing nature sounds & meditation tracks \r\n\r\n<b>5. Customize Your Experience </b>\r\nTailor the app to your preferences for a personalized listening experience. \r\n- Switch between Dark & Light modes for comfortable viewing \r\n- Choose from a variety of theme colors to match your mood \r\n\r\nMusic Stream isn't just an app\u2014it's the rhythm in your step, the melody in your memories, and the soundtrack to your greatest moments. From heart-pounding beats to the thrill of discovering your new favorite artist, we're here to amplify every beat of your journey. \r\n\r\nWith Music Stream, you're not just listening to music\u2014you're living it. Your world, your sound, your rules. \r\n\r\nDownload now and turn every moment into a masterpiece. Your musical adventure awaits\u2014let's compose it together. \r\n\r\nDisclaimer: Music Stream is an online free music streaming service & requires an internet connection for most features. We do not provide caching or downloading of MP3 songs. Offline playback is limited to your local audio files. \r\n\r\nOur content is based on the SoundCloud API & we encourage reporting any copyright issues directly to SoundCloud using their copyright report form https://soundcloud.com/pages/copyright/report \r\nSoundCloud\u00ae native client: https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.soundcloud.android\r\n\r\nWe are committed to supporting a fair & legal online music streaming environment. \r\n\r\nFor more information, visit our website: https://musistream.io \r\nWe welcome your feedback at: contact@musistream.io",
    "descriptionHTML": "Discover millions of trending songs &amp; popular tracks with Music Stream. Powered by SoundCloud, our app offers an unparalleled audio experience, tailored for true music enthusiasts. <br><br>Whether you&#39;re exploring new genres or enjoying your favorite hits, Music Stream is your gateway to a world of limitless free music. Enjoy seamless streaming, curated playlists &amp; a user-friendly interface designed to elevate your listening experience. <br><br><b>Key Features: </b><br>\u25cf Artists Spotlight: Discover albums &amp; playlists by top artists. <br>\u25cf Global Top Charts &amp; Playlists: Tune into trending songs &amp; international chart toppers. <br>\u25cf Genre Explorer: Dive into a diverse array of genres including pop, hip-hop, classical, &amp; jazz. <br>\u25cf Powerful Search: Find all tracks, artists, playlists &amp; albums easily within the app. <br>\u25cf High-Quality Streaming: Enjoy crystal-clear audio streaming with our equalizer &amp; sound booster. <br><br>Music Stream is packed with features to enhance your listening experience. Here are just a few highlights of what you can do: <br><br><b>1. Explore Endless Tracks </b><br>Enter the world of unlimited free music. New high-quality songs await your discovery every day, from chart-toppers to hidden gems. <br>- Access millions of free, high-quality songs across all genres <br>- Discover new tracks daily &amp; listen to top trending songs <br>- Stay updated with daily top charts &amp; trending songs <br><br><b>2. Curate Your Playlists </b><br>Become the curator of your audio world. Build playlists that reflect your essence. Import &amp; export, like your playlists to bookmark them and make your personal online music collection accessible anywhere, anytime. <br>- Create &amp; manage your playlists of favorite songs <br>- Save favorite artists, albums, &amp; genres <br>- Build your online music collection for easy access to high-quality songs <br><br><b>3. Your Songs, Anytime, Anywhere</b><br>Enjoy your favorite playlists, artists, &amp; albums without compromise. Our free music player ensures high-quality song streaming wherever you go. <br>- Access your curated songs collection anywhere <br>- Experience uninterrupted playback <br><br><b>4. Ambient Sounds &amp; Mood-Based Playlists </b><br>Enhance any moment with our carefully curated selection of ambient sounds &amp; mood-based playlists. <br>- Find the perfect playlist for any mood or activity <br>- Unwind with relaxing nature sounds &amp; meditation tracks <br><br><b>5. Customize Your Experience </b><br>Tailor the app to your preferences for a personalized listening experience. <br>- Switch between Dark &amp; Light modes for comfortable viewing <br>- Choose from a variety of theme colors to match your mood <br><br>Music Stream isn&#39;t just an app\u2014it&#39;s the rhythm in your step, the melody in your memories, and the soundtrack to your greatest moments. From heart-pounding beats to the thrill of discovering your new favorite artist, we&#39;re here to amplify every beat of your journey. <br><br>With Music Stream, you&#39;re not just listening to music\u2014you&#39;re living it. Your world, your sound, your rules. <br><br>Download now and turn every moment into a masterpiece. Your musical adventure awaits\u2014let&#39;s compose it together. <br><br>Disclaimer: Music Stream is an online free music streaming service &amp; requires an internet connection for most features. We do not provide caching or downloading of MP3 songs. Offline playback is limited to your local audio files. <br><br>Our content is based on the SoundCloud API &amp; we encourage reporting any copyright issues directly to SoundCloud using their copyright report form https://soundcloud.com/pages/copyright/report <br>SoundCloud\u00ae native client: https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.soundcloud.android<br><br>We are committed to supporting a fair &amp; legal online music streaming environment. <br><br>For more information, visit our website: https://musistream.io <br>We welcome your feedback at: contact@musistream.io",
